@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Requires an active session — run the Login request in auth.http first.
# REST Client shares its cookie jar across files in the same VS Code window.

### List notifications (also marks any currently-unread ones as read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications

### Get unread notification count (for the nav badge; does not mark anything as read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
